WEBVTT

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:15.890
On that cold night, I came to realize

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:20.870
that there's a place deeper down
that hurts even more than injuries

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:26.100
In this world painted with lies

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:30.710
where it's not clear what's true anymore

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:33.610
I wanted to keep you safe

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:40.750
The moment that
distortion and love overlapped,

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:48.830
the wind embraced the
sadness that had closed in

00:00:48.830 --> 00:01:00.140
I'll never forget your sole voice
that continues to echo through the sky

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:08.980
The prayer is going to melt
away and disappear, just like snow

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:13.620
Today, I'll increase my speed again

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.720
as I search for the reason for living

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:29.120
even if I can't be a hero just yet

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:44.280
I want you to hold on to this.

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:49.150
Zwolf's defenses can't stop Xargin.

00:01:49.150 --> 00:01:51.620
In the end, it looks like not even our base

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:55.530
could serve as humanity's last stronghold.

00:01:55.530 --> 00:01:59.360
So we need to disperse
the risk while we have time.

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:00.700
What's this?

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:04.730
Design data for the Isis anti-nanomachines.

00:02:08.010 --> 00:02:13.780
Bio-weapons that destroy a Pale
Horse keeper's body from the inside.

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:20.620
This is probably the only thing
left capable of defeating Xargin now.

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:23.420
We destroyed the data at HQ before we escaped,

00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:28.430
so the only copies left are
this and what's inside my head.

00:02:28.430 --> 00:02:30.800
It hasn't fallen into enemy hands yet.

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:32.960
Why are you giving it to me?

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:35.270
Using the Isis data,

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:39.200
it wouldn't be difficult to
restart Pale Horse development.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:43.270
If it falls into the hands of
people who want that power,

00:02:43.270 --> 00:02:47.610
a second or third Zwolf will also rise up.

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:51.150
So we want someone who
realizes what that means to keep it safe.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:57.290
Of course, if Xargin learns
about the Isis, he won't sit by quietly.

00:02:57.290 --> 00:03:02.730
I apologize for putting
you into even more danger.

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:09.100
It's all right. We'll keep
this data safe, no matter what!

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:13.610
I'm sorry. I wasn't even
able to help Malek-kun...

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:16.810
This isn't the time for that yet, that's all.

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:20.610
So don't forget the promise you made.

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:25.450
Make sure you survive
and help my brother, Sasha.

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:28.040
You're not allowed to die yet. Got it?

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:44.630
What are you going to do now?

00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:47.870
We're returning to base.

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:53.010
The only way to complete the
Isis is to use the materials there.

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:56.480
Thankfully, Mei-Fong
quarantined the infected areas,

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:59.350
so the lab should still be fully functional.

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:02.390
Sasha!

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:04.390
It worries me that the U.N. Forces

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:07.390
haven't given any sort of
reaction to Zwolf's destruction.

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:08.590
Let's hurry!

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:10.330
Yes.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:14.200
Amanda! If you don't see any
activity by tomorrow morning,

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:18.140
escape into Germany over the nearest border!

00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:21.630
Roger that. Don't worry about us.

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:43.960
Listen, Malek. Are you still in there, hiding?

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:47.420
Even I'm scared that I've wound up like this.

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:51.540
I'm sure Gerd was scared, too.

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:54.870
The champ and I are just like you.

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:57.540
We're afraid this power will take over us

00:04:57.540 --> 00:05:01.710
and that we'll do something
very wrong someday...

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:05.080
I'm always screwing up at the
most important times, you see.

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:09.190
I always end up regretting
things after it's too late.

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:10.990
But even so...

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:13.760
Each time we realize we've made a mistake,

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:17.530
we get one step closer to the right path, right?

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:22.430
Malek. You know the mistakes you've made.

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:25.240
You can't let that go to waste!

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:31.410
It's possible you'll meet your end
without finding the right answer too.

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:35.980
Even so, someday someone
who remembers the mistakes

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:40.790
that you, me, and Gerd
made will use them as guideposts

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:44.320
and search for a new path.

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:48.350
In that sense, our lives will mean something.

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:57.070
It's okay to be afraid. It's okay to be worried.

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:59.800
Don't stand still. Keep moving forward.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:06.180
Malek. Surely you must see
something that only you can do now.

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:08.270
Don't take your eyes off it.

00:06:13.590 --> 00:06:16.620
Quarantine of the infected
parts of the network is complete.

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:21.530
Approximately 40% of the
entire facility remains functional.

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:23.700
What's the plan for rescuing the commander?

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:26.060
Rescuing?

00:06:26.060 --> 00:06:28.900
Yes. He is still conscious.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:30.840
You can't be serious!

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:35.670
In his state, the commander is
hardly capable of human reasoning!

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:38.240
Aside from the lack of
enhanced physical abilities,

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:41.210
he's no different from an Amalgam!

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:43.750
In fact, we need to figure out a disposal plan

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:46.740
before the outer network is breached!

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:52.690
All right. Sasha's group should be back soon.

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:55.430
Prepare to re-supply and
check the Apocalypse Knights.

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:57.830
R-Right.

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:03.590
Grandfather...

00:07:09.140 --> 00:07:11.580
Isis...

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:14.910
Is this a plan to poison and kill Xargin-sama?

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:24.690
Damn! All the details have been deleted!

00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:29.060
But they would never
abandon a project of this scale.

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:32.030
The only chance they would've
had to leave with the data was...

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:37.000
Those two units, huh?

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:40.340
Even though there's
nothing to fear from Zwolf now,

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:43.740
if their trump card has been taken outside,

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:48.750
then even more fools will
continue to stand in Xargin-sama's way.

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:50.870
I can't ignore this.

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:05.300
Was it really a good
idea to bring Blue here too?

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:07.130
His name is Joseph.

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:09.530
You still suspect him?

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:13.570
I'm still not convinced about him.

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:15.470
Hermann...

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:22.450
When he wakes up, I'm going to
grill him about why he killed Gerd

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:26.280
and if he's really to blame
for the incident with Malek.

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:29.350
I hope it's a simple, quiet conversation,

00:08:29.350 --> 00:08:34.390
but your weird similarities
make you like water and oil:

00:08:34.390 --> 00:08:36.960
Whenever you're together
you're liable to get into a fight.

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:39.760
How am I similar to him?!

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:42.870
You're quick to brood and then rush off.

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:46.140
You try to carry everything
on your back all by yourself.

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:49.270
I could keep listing
plenty of other things, too.

00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:52.570
Let's get one thing straight!

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:55.810
What's wrong?

00:08:55.810 --> 00:08:58.080
Nothing.

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:02.520
You're always defending him,
so I can't help but get pissed.

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:06.390
I think I'll get some
fresh air to cool off a bit.

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:09.460
Sheesh.

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:26.280
I'm so pathetic. I couldn't say
what I wanted to say this time, either.

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:29.380
They say death is the only cure for stupidity,

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:34.220
but staying stupid even
after dying once is pathetic.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:38.920
It's gonna get mighty cold tonight.

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:46.190
This is...

00:09:48.430 --> 00:09:52.370
I'm sorry for always
making you do this work, Vice.

00:09:53.810 --> 00:09:57.260
Vice! Vice!

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:04.480
This isn't good. Even though
he's old, he's the owner's favorite.

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:06.820
We forced him to work too hard!

00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:10.760
Vice isn't young anymore!
Please let him rest a little bit!

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:15.960
We can't afford to take care
of a horse that can't even work.

00:10:15.960 --> 00:10:17.960
That's... poison!

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:23.460
Take it. Put it in his next meal.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:31.040
We can say he died of old age
rather than admitting we injured him.

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:33.740
It'll be good to be rid of it anyway.

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:35.440
We're counting on you.

00:10:36.710 --> 00:10:38.050
Poison?

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:44.790
They use him for so long and then
kill him like this once he's a burden?

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.450
That's horrible!

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:01.660
Okay, let's go, Vice.

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:11.250
I hate the snow. It brings
back pointless memories.

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:16.690
Come out. We're both too old for hide-and-seek.

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:22.790
I came when I felt the same
thing as when I was fighting Wolf...

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:28.060
So why did I run into you, of all people?

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:31.070
You're clueless, aren't you?

00:11:31.070 --> 00:11:36.610
Just who do you think gave you your power?

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:42.310
I see. So I've been dancing
to your tune this entire time?

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:48.450
There's no need to be embarrassed,
Hermann. You weren't the only fool.

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:49.320
What?!

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:54.930
Gerd, Malek, and even Wolf
were defeated by their own weakness

00:11:54.930 --> 00:11:59.730
and were enchanted by their
new power into doing my bidding.

00:11:59.730 --> 00:12:05.540
But every one was an incompetent
fool who couldn't control that power.

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:09.010
You've been nothing but disappointments.

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:13.710
Damn you! So it was all your fault?!

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:16.310
You'll pay for this, you scum!

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:18.780
How dreadful.

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:23.920
You're going to use the power
I gave you to stand up to me?

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:29.630
Quit acting big! You got your power from Xargin!

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:32.660
So how are you any different from me?

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:38.040
I'm in a very bad mood today!

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:42.740
If you don't understand,
then I'll just have to show you

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:45.000
how definitively different we are!

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:56.250
Don't get cocky, you puppet with broken strings!

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:58.820
Don't you get cocky!

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:02.820
What makes you think you can play
with people's fates like they're toys?!

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:31.820
I wound up with this body because of you...

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:34.660
...but now I almost want to thank you!

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:42.030
Even though I've died once, I can
still fight to protect what's dear to me...

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:45.130
...despite what you wanted!

00:13:50.070 --> 00:13:51.140
Silence!

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:55.550
A man of your lowliness isn't allowed
to talk about this power's meaning!

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:39.160
Vice! Get up, Vice!

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:43.090
We took you in, and this is how you repay us?!

00:14:56.540 --> 00:15:01.310
Well, no matter. This will
make for a believable story.

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:07.150
I'll inform the owner that a
servant stole and killed this horse

00:15:07.150 --> 00:15:10.750
and that she was punished severely for it!

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:23.430
With your injuries, you won't survive.

00:15:23.430 --> 00:15:25.100
Who are?

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:35.150
Even so, do you still wish to
live longer in this cruel world?

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:39.520
Help him... Please help him...

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:43.250
Very well.

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:48.690
Your kindness and spirit make
you worthy to walk beside me.

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:58.900
I'll never let someone as lowly as you

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:02.400
get in the way of Xargin-sama's ideals!

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:07.300
You're not the only one who won't compromise!

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:23.520
Not yet! I can't be finished yet!

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:31.060
Hermann?!

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:47.850
You're the last one.

00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:51.280
The woman who was with Xargin!

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:04.600
Run, Amanda!

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:05.340
Hermann!

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:07.710
Why won't you just die?!

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:10.240
Let go!

00:17:10.240 --> 00:17:11.510
Amanda!

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:13.810
Let go, damn it!

00:17:13.810 --> 00:17:15.710
Run!

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:17.950
Hermann!

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:20.780
Damn you both!

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:22.920
Hermann!

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:26.160
Malek...

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:30.120
Malek!

00:17:38.540 --> 00:17:42.270
That's where the real suffering begins.

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:47.980
The pain of hurting others is
often worse than the pain of being hurt.

00:17:47.980 --> 00:17:51.020
Joseph was right...

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:54.250
It's this frightening, this painful!

00:17:55.190 --> 00:17:59.820
Malek. You know the mistakes you've made.

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:03.530
You can't let that go to waste!

00:18:03.530 --> 00:18:06.050
Was it the same for you, Joseph?

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:11.130
You endured it and fought anyway, didn't you?

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:15.470
I wasn't a hero at all.

00:18:15.470 --> 00:18:19.440
I just wound up like them, that's all.

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:21.110
Even so...

00:18:21.110 --> 00:18:23.640
...they still think of me and...

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:37.330
Hermann! Now!

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:38.990
Malek!

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:47.530
Damn you... Damn you!

00:18:57.580 --> 00:19:02.750
Xargin-sama...

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:23.040
The Lord giveth, and the Lord taketh away.

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:26.640
Blessed be thy name. Amen.

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:44.630
Malek...

00:19:44.630 --> 00:19:53.540
See, when you're awake,
you actually look pretty good...

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:58.200
Hermann... I...

00:20:09.090 --> 00:20:12.060
Tell me, Malek...

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:14.730
If I weren't like this now,

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:20.560
do you think I could've made a good big brother?

00:20:23.930 --> 00:20:29.310
Really? Thanks...

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:33.580
Now I think I can finally say it.

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:35.240
Amanda...

00:21:54.120 --> 00:22:05.240
I dreamed of that day we chased shooting stars

00:22:05.240 --> 00:22:15.650
What we had kept safe disappeared like sand

00:22:15.650 --> 00:22:19.720
Just another illusion

00:22:19.720 --> 00:22:28.820
Asleep, inside memories

00:22:30.060 --> 00:22:32.360
Wish for the stars

00:22:32.360 --> 00:22:40.900
Holding countless wishes with both hands

00:22:40.900 --> 00:22:43.470
A wish for the stars

00:22:43.470 --> 00:22:51.420
Quietly by your side, as you sleep

00:22:51.420 --> 00:22:57.050
Yes, right next to you

00:22:57.050 --> 00:23:03.030
Holding countless wishes

00:23:03.030 --> 00:23:08.790
Yes, right beside you

00:23:12.540 --> 00:23:17.370
A countdown to annihilation.
Looming flames of destruction.

00:23:17.370 --> 00:23:23.280
On the battlefield all have given
up on, the men continue to fight.

00:23:23.280 --> 00:23:27.320
Episode 23: "Scorched Earth."

00:23:27.320 --> 00:23:32.350
Led by their desires, the two at
last make their way to the final battle.
